<title>UK: Hamburg Hypo sets 100 mln mark bond.</title>
<headline>Hamburg Hypo sets 100 mln mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following step-up bond was announced by lead manager Dresdner Kleinwort Benson.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HYPOTHEKENBANK IN HAMBURG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON    *4.0	 MATURITY   *23.JUL.01</p>
<p> TYPE   STEP-UP	 ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE    23.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    HAMBURG   DENOMS (K)  ONE</p>
<p> NOTES     *TO 23.JUL.97, THEN STEPS-UP TO 4.85 PCT IF NOT</p>
<p>		CALLED AT PAR</p>
<p>		OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF 977</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
